  "reason": "v8: lore effects for the fallen dracolich fortress: smouldering dracolich eyes (AE Dracolich_Bone VFX), skeletal bats crossing the moon (AQW Bat2 flap loop), torch light pools, wall-lantern flicker, falling ash and cinders, swaying Shadowscythe banners. No green window glow (clashes with the red palette). v9: parallax speeds x1.7 to keep v3-v8 depth shift with the wider (87% height) camera framing. v10: the window-glow overlay (1/174) and the wall lanterns (1/206, 1/208, 1/300) were grouped with the Ground and slid off their wall under parallax; they now ride DistantCastle, and lantern glows sit on the lamps' source centres. v11: depth planes by actual distance (moon 48, sky 40, castle 16, rampart 8, courtyard wall 4, walking plane 0, foreground rock -12 on FrontAll); the enclosed Garden1 wall drops to 3 so its base stays on the floor."
